1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 29=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:46,580
(Glorify the Family Name)

7
00:01:51,790 --> 00:01:53,760
Mother only said that
to comfort Madam Wu.

8
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:55,040
She didn't mean any of it.

9
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,480
Don't take it to heart.

10
00:01:57,150 --> 00:01:57,950
All right.

11
00:02:00,360 --> 00:02:01,784
You're being awfully agreeable.

12
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:03,704
Is it because
we're visiting your family today?

13
00:02:10,030 --> 00:02:11,470
I cannot stay by my parents' side

14
00:02:11,528 --> 00:02:12,680
and fulfill my duty to them.

15
00:02:13,430 --> 00:02:15,470
I don't want them
worrying about me anymore.

16
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:18,960
No matter how things are for me here,

17
00:02:19,870 --> 00:02:21,150
in front of my parents,

18
00:02:21,630 --> 00:02:22,840
I'll always say I'm doing well.

19
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:25,310
I hope you'll help me
keep up appearances.

20
00:02:26,590 --> 00:02:28,080
And I'll return the favor

21
00:02:28,136 --> 00:02:29,430
by respecting your parents

22
00:02:29,976 --> 00:02:31,840
and never putting you
in a difficult position.

23
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:36,400
Don't worry.

24
00:02:40,590 --> 00:02:42,430
I won't disappoint your parents.

25
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:57,120
Actually,

26
00:02:57,192 --> 00:02:59,624
if you really want to
put your parents' minds at ease,

27
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,590
come to the capital with me.

28
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:03,800
Then you'll be the madam
of the household.

29
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,240
How you live your life

30
00:03:05,910 --> 00:03:07,280
will be entirely up to you.

31
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,360
You should go on your own.

32
00:03:09,470 --> 00:03:10,710
I'll stay in Jinling

33
00:03:11,150 --> 00:03:13,120
and fulfill your filial duties
in your stead.

34
00:03:16,660 --> 00:03:21,580
(Glorify the Family Name)

35
00:03:28,870 --> 00:03:30,560
Are you cold, Young Master?

36
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:32,590
No.

37
00:03:37,870 --> 00:03:38,870
Bring me the cloak.

38
00:03:39,630 --> 00:03:40,400
No need.

39
00:03:40,552 --> 00:03:43,064
Those of us trained in martial arts
aren't afraid of the cold.

40
00:03:56,630 --> 00:03:57,630
Now that you mention it,

41
00:03:58,280 --> 00:03:59,630
I am feeling a little cold.

42
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,560
If Mother sees

43
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:08,400
me wearing the cloak she made

44
00:04:08,590 --> 00:04:09,870
when we visit her together,

45
00:04:10,150 --> 00:04:12,190
she must think we newlyweds

46
00:04:12,430 --> 00:04:14,030
are very happy together.

47
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:54,750
We're hardly a young
newlywed couple at our age.

48
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,310
How can you even say that?

49
00:05:14,232 --> 00:05:15,304
What are you laughing at?

50
00:05:16,390 --> 00:05:16,830
Move.

51
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:34,600
I pay my respects to you, Mother.

52
00:05:40,870 --> 00:05:41,560
Come inside.

53
00:05:41,768 --> 00:05:42,830
Come in and sit down.

54
00:05:50,510 --> 00:05:51,750
You're here. Come.

55
00:05:51,750 --> 00:05:52,390
Mother.

56
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:53,600
Come.

57
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,310
Here, first,

58
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:58,040
have some hot tea.

59
00:06:01,190 --> 00:06:02,240
Warm yourself up.

60
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:12,070
I'm not cold at all.

61
00:06:12,184 --> 00:06:13,672
I'm wearing the cloak you made for me.

62
00:06:13,870 --> 00:06:14,720
It's very warm.

63
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,870
Look. My palms are even sweating.

64
00:06:20,830 --> 00:06:22,720
Come, sit down.

65
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:23,950
Sit.

66
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:45,000
Mother, are you stewing chicken?

67
00:06:47,070 --> 00:06:48,390
Our home isn't very big,

68
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:50,600
so the kitchen is close by.

69
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,000
Is the smell too...

70
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,390
It smells wonderful.

71
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,600
I clearly ate my fill this morning,

72
00:06:56,070 --> 00:06:56,870
but now

73
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:58,088
the aroma of chicken soup

74
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,880
and the sight
of these fried dough twists

75
00:06:59,976 --> 00:07:01,040
have made me hungry again.

76
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:03,240
If you don't mind,

77
00:07:03,432 --> 00:07:05,064
I'd love a bowl of chicken soup

78
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:06,200
with some fried dough twists.

79
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:08,480
Wait here.

80
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:14,070
You're young, so of course
you have a good appetite.

81
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,390
You're family. Make yourself at home.

82
00:07:17,950 --> 00:07:19,000
Father is right.

83
00:07:19,750 --> 00:07:21,070
I am young.

84
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,720
Father is right.

85
00:07:27,310 --> 00:07:28,680
You're still young.

86
00:07:32,070 --> 00:07:33,070
Here, Jinqi.

87
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:34,360
Try some.

88
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:34,920
Sure.

89
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,120
Thank you, Mother.

90
00:07:46,216 --> 00:07:49,160
The soup is savory, and the fried
dough twists are fragrant. Delicious.

91
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:58,800
They say one shouldn't talk
while eating or sleeping.

92
00:07:59,190 --> 00:08:00,480
I thought Young Master...

93
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:03,560
I thought you weren't allowed

94
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:04,800
to talk while eating.

95
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,390
We're not that particular.

96
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,830
Back in the military camp,

97
00:08:08,270 --> 00:08:10,360
we'd even eat while arguing.

98
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:22,870
Mother, look.

99
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:25,600
Lanxiang keeps staring at me
without saying a word.

100
00:08:26,070 --> 00:08:27,480
She must think I'm eating too much.

101
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,840
I don't mind how much he eats.

102
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:37,120
Watching him enjoy it

103
00:08:37,130 --> 00:08:38,990
just made me want
some fried dough twists, too.

104
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:41,120
If you want some, just say so.

105
00:08:41,270 --> 00:08:42,840
It's not like I'd deprive you.

106
00:08:44,150 --> 00:08:44,790
Come.

107
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:48,910
Here.

108
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:59,600
Have you been busy with official duties?

109
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,870
I've already completed the handover.

110
00:09:01,870 --> 00:09:02,870
I'm not busy at all.

111
00:09:07,030 --> 00:09:07,910
Father, Mother,

112
00:09:08,670 --> 00:09:10,790
there's something

113
00:09:10,790 --> 00:09:12,080
I need to tell you both.

114
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:15,550
His Majesty has ordered me
to take up a post in the capital.

115
00:09:16,270 --> 00:09:17,360
It was all very sudden.

116
00:09:17,510 --> 00:09:18,670
I have to leave tomorrow.

117
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,720
I want

118
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:23,670
to take Lanxiang with me.

119
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,080
I see.

120
00:09:27,192 --> 00:09:28,824
This is such an important matter.

121
00:09:29,390 --> 00:09:31,750
Why didn't you send
someone back to tell us?

122
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,270
We could've prepared

123
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:35,030
some things for you in advance.

124
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:38,080
He's going. I'm not.

125
00:09:38,270 --> 00:09:39,630
That's why we didn't tell you.

126
00:09:40,630 --> 00:09:43,000
Lanxiang is mainly worried
about the two of you.

127
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:45,150
But once I leave,

128
00:09:45,150 --> 00:09:47,256
I'm afraid I won't
be back for two or three years.

129
00:09:47,870 --> 00:09:51,144
I wouldn't feel at ease leaving
Lanxiang alone at the residence.

130
00:09:51,270 --> 00:09:52,720
So I can only ask

131
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:55,048
that you let Lanxiang
come to the capital with me.

132
00:09:59,150 --> 00:10:00,840
Jinqi has a point.

133
00:10:01,390 --> 00:10:03,120
You've only just gotten married.

134
00:10:03,790 --> 00:10:06,030
You can't be apart for so long.

135
00:10:07,030 --> 00:10:08,720
Your mother and I are in good health.

136
00:10:08,730 --> 00:10:10,030
You don't need to worry about us.

137
00:10:10,550 --> 00:10:11,120
Yes.

138
00:10:11,670 --> 00:10:14,630
Now that Jinqi is going
to the capital to take up a post,

139
00:10:16,390 --> 00:10:18,870
you should go with him.

140
00:10:20,870 --> 00:10:22,790
I nearly died from illness
in the capital.

141
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,000
I don't want to go.

142
00:10:42,030 --> 00:10:44,000
Lanxiang has been frail since childhood.

143
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,510
In the capital,

144
00:10:45,912 --> 00:10:47,550
she nearly... nearly died from illness.

145
00:10:48,390 --> 00:10:49,270
It frightened her.

146
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:52,030
How about this?

147
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:53,270
You...

148
00:10:53,870 --> 00:10:55,120
You go on ahead.

149
00:10:55,550 --> 00:10:56,480
In a few days,

150
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:58,670
when Lanxiang comes around,

151
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:00,080
she can join you there.

152
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,510
There'll still be time.

153
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:10,790
Mother, the chicken soup has gone cold.

154
00:11:10,870 --> 00:11:12,150
I'll go get another hot bowl.

155
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:13,870
Sit down.

156
00:11:13,870 --> 00:11:15,200
It's fine. I'll get it myself.

157
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:15,960
Just sit down.

158
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:16,750
No. You two...

159
00:11:16,750 --> 00:11:17,750
Give it to me. Come on.

160
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:19,150
- Sit down.
- Sit.

161
00:11:19,150 --> 00:11:19,910
Thank you, Mother.

162
00:11:20,808 --> 00:11:21,620
Father, please sit.

163
00:11:21,630 --> 00:11:22,360
All right.

164
00:11:27,670 --> 00:11:29,270
Finest quality fabric!

165
00:11:30,150 --> 00:11:32,510
Sachets! Come take
a look at our sachets!

166
00:11:34,270 --> 00:11:36,120
Come take a look at our sachets!

167
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:37,900
(Lu Family Painting
and Calligraphy Shop)

168
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:41,910
Sachets!

169
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:43,960
Take care!

170
00:11:44,968 --> 00:11:46,470
One book bag and one pencil case.

171
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:47,270
Sure.

172
00:11:53,150 --> 00:11:54,320
Jiugao, come help.

173
00:11:54,750 --> 00:11:56,480
That'll be 1.6 coins.

174
00:11:57,870 --> 00:11:59,030
Jiugao, wrap these up.

175
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:05,000
Why is business suddenly so good?

176
00:12:05,010 --> 00:12:07,064
Could it be because
His Majesty granted the marriage

177
00:12:07,112 --> 00:12:09,120
and they're here to see
what all the fuss is about?

178
00:12:10,270 --> 00:12:11,510
Who would spend real money

179
00:12:11,630 --> 00:12:13,360
just to see what all the fuss is about?

180
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:15,670
Scholar Han

181
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:17,600
lives next door.

182
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:19,870
Now,

183
00:12:20,168 --> 00:12:23,000
word has spread that the pencil case
and book bag Scholar Han uses

184
00:12:23,150 --> 00:12:24,080
came from the shop.

185
00:12:24,280 --> 00:12:25,944
So people come
to share his good fortune,

186
00:12:25,992 --> 00:12:28,040
and that they'll pass
the examination next year too.

187
00:12:29,896 --> 00:12:32,120
So the top provincial graduate
actually lives next door.

188
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:34,720
What a stroke of luck.

189
00:12:34,750 --> 00:12:35,720
There's no stopping it.

190
00:12:36,550 --> 00:12:37,080
Shopkeeper.

191
00:12:37,870 --> 00:12:38,750
How much is all this?

192
00:12:39,270 --> 00:12:40,150
Let me see.

193
00:12:40,550 --> 00:12:41,390
The books...

194
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:42,630
and this.

195
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:45,080
That'll be 7.1 coins altogether.

196
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:45,670
All right.

197
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:47,510
Here.

198
00:12:48,968 --> 00:12:50,000
Thank you for your business.

199
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:50,550
Thank you.

200
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:51,600
Take care.

201
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:53,000
Take care.

202
00:13:08,750 --> 00:13:09,750
How many sachets?

203
00:13:12,390 --> 00:13:13,030
Three.

204
00:14:05,510 --> 00:14:06,440
What are you doing?

205
00:14:09,270 --> 00:14:10,960
If you put another bug on my head,

206
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:12,520
I'm really going to hit you this time.

207
00:14:22,088 --> 00:14:23,390
I'm not a child anymore.

208
00:14:23,670 --> 00:14:25,120
Can you stop treating me like one?

209
00:14:30,630 --> 00:14:31,630
They're silk flowers.

210
00:14:47,544 --> 00:14:49,120
I saw them while I was out shopping.

211
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:51,200
They said they were from the capital,

212
00:14:51,870 --> 00:14:53,360
so I bought two on a whim.

213
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:58,550
This is clearly Jinling silk.

214
00:15:02,790 --> 00:15:04,150
You may have been fooled,

215
00:15:04,328 --> 00:15:05,656
but they still look nice.

216
00:15:08,270 --> 00:15:09,320
I'll keep one

217
00:15:09,550 --> 00:15:10,870
and give the other to Yinchen.

218
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:16,440
These new items
need to be sorted, right?

219
00:15:40,104 --> 00:15:42,200
You've walked past here
three times already.

220
00:15:42,328 --> 00:15:43,960
This isn't a shop you should be eyeing.

221
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:44,750
Let go of me!

222
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:47,840
Please, let go of me!

223
00:15:55,670 --> 00:15:56,480
It's you?

224
00:16:00,630 --> 00:16:01,480
Zhi.

225
00:16:02,670 --> 00:16:03,790
It really is you.

226
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:08,600
You...

227
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:31,630
Father.

228
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,030
For this visit,

229
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:34,510
Lanxiang and I also prepared

230
00:16:34,510 --> 00:16:35,480
a gift for Mister Lu.

231
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:38,000
I'd like to pay him a visit, too.

232
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:39,790
I'll take you there.

233
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:43,720
All right.

234
00:16:49,670 --> 00:16:51,550
Don't be afraid, child.

235
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:53,000
Don't be afraid.

236
00:16:53,550 --> 00:16:54,910
Didn't you go home?

237
00:16:56,870 --> 00:16:58,240
How did you end up like this?

238
00:16:59,150 --> 00:17:00,440
What happened?

239
00:17:02,910 --> 00:17:03,960
Say something.

240
00:17:05,590 --> 00:17:06,240
Mother,

241
00:17:06,856 --> 00:17:08,310
go get her a bowl of chicken soup.

242
00:17:08,790 --> 00:17:10,830
I'll take Zhi inside
for some food first.

243
00:17:11,310 --> 00:17:12,750
Once she's feeling better,

244
00:17:12,880 --> 00:17:14,000
we can catch up slowly.

245
00:17:47,510 --> 00:17:49,480
Let's go inside. Come.

246
00:18:16,400 --> 00:18:17,070
Sit down.

247
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:33,920
Here's the chicken soup.

248
00:18:36,110 --> 00:18:37,350
Eat something first.

249
00:18:38,030 --> 00:18:39,000
Have it while it's hot.

250
00:18:40,440 --> 00:18:41,640
I'll heat some water.

251
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:42,680
You can wash up later.

252
00:18:53,384 --> 00:18:54,830
You've been hungry for so long.

253
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:57,030
Have something soft first
to warm your stomach.

254
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:00,510
Once you're feeling better,

255
00:19:00,720 --> 00:19:01,830
I'll give you some meat.

256
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:12,720
My parents thought I was a disgrace.

257
00:19:28,590 --> 00:19:29,440
They said

258
00:19:30,880 --> 00:19:32,310
I never should've gone back.

259
00:19:34,030 --> 00:19:35,590
I should've died out there.

260
00:19:39,920 --> 00:19:41,960
They sold me to a cripple

261
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:44,830
in exchange for a calf.

262
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:49,680
I couldn't endure the abuse,

263
00:19:51,160 --> 00:19:52,350
so I ran away.

264
00:19:55,070 --> 00:19:55,960
But

265
00:19:57,960 --> 00:20:00,070
I don't seem to know where else to go.

266
00:20:04,590 --> 00:20:06,270
I kept walking

267
00:20:10,310 --> 00:20:11,720
and walking

268
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:16,030
until my shoes wore through,

269
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:19,590
but I still didn't know where to go.

270
00:20:32,270 --> 00:20:33,000
Eat.

271
00:20:34,248 --> 00:20:36,510
Once you've had your fill
and regained your strength,

272
00:20:36,632 --> 00:20:38,120
we'll look for somewhere together.

273
00:20:39,070 --> 00:20:40,240
The world is so vast.

274
00:20:40,750 --> 00:20:41,680
We'll find you a place

275
00:20:41,880 --> 00:20:43,480
one way or another.

276
00:20:57,830 --> 00:20:58,790
Drink up.

277
00:21:42,270 --> 00:21:43,960
Are you still looking for Ji'er?

278
00:21:48,720 --> 00:21:51,350
Mister Lu and Furong are helping, too,

279
00:21:52,310 --> 00:21:53,680
but there's been no news.

280
00:21:56,030 --> 00:21:56,720
Still,

281
00:21:57,480 --> 00:21:59,510
performers travel far
and wide with their shows.

282
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:01,720
We'll hear something eventually.

283
00:22:03,830 --> 00:22:05,160
I know where Ji'er is.

284
00:22:12,550 --> 00:22:13,680
On my way here,

285
00:22:14,640 --> 00:22:16,960
I saw that branded mule.

286
00:22:18,000 --> 00:22:20,030
So while I was begging for leftovers,

287
00:22:20,480 --> 00:22:22,240
I went closer and listened carefully.

288
00:22:23,350 --> 00:22:24,510
What did you hear?

289
00:22:26,640 --> 00:22:28,750
They do business in the capital.

290
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:30,960
Ji'er is in the capital.

291
00:22:35,160 --> 00:22:37,110
Will you go
to the capital to find Ji'er?

292
00:22:37,960 --> 00:22:38,720
Of course.

293
00:22:39,816 --> 00:22:42,088
I'll leave for the capital
first thing tomorrow morning.

294
00:22:43,640 --> 00:22:44,720
Tomorrow morning?

295
00:22:51,830 --> 00:22:52,400
Here.

296
00:22:52,640 --> 00:22:55,240
My son-in-law is going
to the capital to take up his post.

297
00:22:55,784 --> 00:22:57,592
It's been decided
that he'll leave tomorrow.

298
00:22:57,680 --> 00:22:59,590
Lanxiang didn't want to go at first,

299
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:01,000
but now it seems

300
00:23:02,110 --> 00:23:03,680
she has no choice but to go.

301
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:05,830
Come in and test the water.

302
00:23:07,070 --> 00:23:07,960
You have chilblains,

303
00:23:08,160 --> 00:23:09,880
so I didn't make the water too hot.

304
00:23:10,350 --> 00:23:11,160
Take it slowly.

305
00:23:17,580 --> 00:23:22,500
♪Whose voice is still singing?♪

306
00:23:23,240 --> 00:23:24,030
Is this all right?

307
00:23:24,030 --> 00:23:28,140
♪A faint melody
drifts through my dreams♪

308
00:23:28,860 --> 00:23:33,500
♪A cold soul crosses the river,
gazing toward the loyal family afar♪

309
00:23:33,500 --> 00:23:36,700
♪As if destined by fate♪

310
00:23:36,700 --> 00:23:40,440
♪To reunite, then wander once more♪

311
00:23:40,440 --> 00:23:41,110
Zhi.

312
00:23:41,448 --> 00:23:43,440
Tomorrow, we'll go
to the capital together.

313
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:45,160
We'll find Ji'er together.

314
00:23:47,310 --> 00:23:48,070
All right.

315
00:23:48,070 --> 00:23:51,660
♪Promises are like candlelight,
flickering in the wind♪

316
00:23:51,980 --> 00:23:54,380
♪I watch the passing years wear away♪

317
00:23:54,380 --> 00:23:58,140
♪Even deep affection slowly fades♪

318
00:23:58,140 --> 00:24:00,860
♪The past falls like withered leaves♪

319
00:24:00,860 --> 00:24:05,300
♪Scattered into the dust♪

320
00:24:07,480 --> 00:24:08,240
Young Master.

321
00:24:08,648 --> 00:24:11,400
These are sachets from the Lu Family
Painting and Calligraphy Shop,

322
00:24:11,400 --> 00:24:12,880
along with pencil cases and book bags.

323
00:24:14,728 --> 00:24:16,000
Why are you giving me these?

324
00:24:16,790 --> 00:24:18,200
This year's top provincial graduate

325
00:24:18,240 --> 00:24:19,720
lives next door to the shop.

326
00:24:19,790 --> 00:24:21,560
Many scholars
have gone there to buy them,

327
00:24:21,608 --> 00:24:23,400
saying they'll share in his good fortune

328
00:24:23,440 --> 00:24:24,830
and pass the examination next year.

329
00:24:25,200 --> 00:24:26,270
I was thinking

330
00:24:26,270 --> 00:24:28,240
you could send these to Pengjian Study

331
00:24:28,240 --> 00:24:29,440
in Young Madam's name.

332
00:24:30,270 --> 00:24:32,640
Third Young Master and
Fourth Young Master are studying now,

333
00:24:32,640 --> 00:24:34,424
so they might share
in his good fortune, too.

334
00:24:34,790 --> 00:24:36,550
If they pass the examination one day,

335
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:40,550
Second Madam may remember
Young Madam's kindness.

336
00:24:42,000 --> 00:24:43,110
The top provincial graduate?

337
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:46,110
Scholar Han?

338
00:24:51,480 --> 00:24:52,830
What did I do wrong?

339
00:24:53,272 --> 00:24:54,640
Please tell me, Young Master.

340
00:24:57,590 --> 00:25:00,110
You certainly know how to win
people over for Young Madam.

341
00:25:02,960 --> 00:25:05,000
You're leaving for the capital tomorrow.

342
00:25:05,256 --> 00:25:07,016
Young Madam will
be alone at the residence

343
00:25:07,048 --> 00:25:08,200
with no one to rely on.

344
00:25:08,440 --> 00:25:10,400
Naturally, it's best
to win over whoever you can.

345
00:25:19,960 --> 00:25:21,510
Since you're so devoted to her,

346
00:25:22,400 --> 00:25:23,880
take these to Aunt Lingxiao.

347
00:25:24,350 --> 00:25:25,030
Tell her

348
00:25:25,920 --> 00:25:27,160
Young Madam and I

349
00:25:27,270 --> 00:25:28,888
are giving them to Jinqiao and Jincen.

350
00:25:29,880 --> 00:25:30,880
Mention you, too?

351
00:25:34,510 --> 00:25:35,030
Yes.

352
00:26:02,750 --> 00:26:03,880
You can go if you want.

353
00:26:04,270 --> 00:26:05,830
I'm not going to the capital anyway.

354
00:26:06,880 --> 00:26:07,920
You should go on your own.

355
00:26:08,270 --> 00:26:09,440
I'll stay in Jinling

356
00:26:09,880 --> 00:26:11,750
and fulfill your filial duties
in your stead.

357
00:26:11,960 --> 00:26:12,790
I'm not going.

358
00:26:12,856 --> 00:26:13,720
I don't want to go.

359
00:26:34,104 --> 00:26:35,750
I'm leaving for the capital tomorrow.

360
00:26:36,808 --> 00:26:38,776
Knowing we won't see
each other for a long time,

361
00:26:40,072 --> 00:26:41,720
I can't help feeling a little down.

362
00:26:45,288 --> 00:26:47,000
Would you mind having a drink with me?

363
00:27:04,920 --> 00:27:05,830
Actually,

364
00:27:07,640 --> 00:27:09,000
the capital is quite nice.

365
00:27:10,040 --> 00:27:11,672
It's right under the Emperor's watch,

366
00:27:11,704 --> 00:27:13,576
and blessed
with outstanding people and places.

367
00:27:13,928 --> 00:27:14,960
No matter how nice it is,

368
00:27:16,240 --> 00:27:17,350
you still don't like it.

369
00:27:27,480 --> 00:27:28,200
People

370
00:27:28,720 --> 00:27:30,440
can change their minds

371
00:27:31,400 --> 00:27:32,640
over time.

372
00:27:33,240 --> 00:27:34,680
If you don't like it, so be it.

373
00:27:36,960 --> 00:27:38,070
I don't want to force you.

374
00:27:39,832 --> 00:27:42,040
Now that the transfer order
has been issued,

375
00:27:42,376 --> 00:27:44,632
I have no choice
but to report for duty in the capital.

376
00:27:45,790 --> 00:27:46,880
But I promise you

377
00:27:47,160 --> 00:27:49,160
I'll petition His Majesty
as soon as possible

378
00:27:49,304 --> 00:27:50,696
to transfer me back to Jinling.

379
00:27:52,920 --> 00:27:53,960
I'll drink first.

380
00:28:19,110 --> 00:28:21,880
This rice liquor
tastes a little strange.

381
00:28:28,880 --> 00:28:29,750
Actually,

382
00:28:31,270 --> 00:28:32,720
what I wanted to tell you is...

383
00:28:51,240 --> 00:28:52,720
Lin Jinqi, you...

384
00:28:54,750 --> 00:28:56,200
drugged me.

385
00:29:13,460 --> 00:29:16,060
♪Look at us♪

386
00:29:16,940 --> 00:29:21,020
♪We've shared
countless beautiful moments♪

387
00:29:22,400 --> 00:29:23,200
From now on,

388
00:29:24,030 --> 00:29:26,070
you must never drink
carelessly when you're out.

389
00:29:30,030 --> 00:29:31,200
I did promise you

390
00:29:31,336 --> 00:29:33,640
I'd get transferred back
to Jinling as soon as possible.

391
00:29:34,510 --> 00:29:35,590
But I never promised

392
00:29:36,830 --> 00:29:38,200
to leave you behind in Jinling.

393
00:29:38,200 --> 00:29:40,220
♪However deep the joy or sorrow♪

394
00:29:41,100 --> 00:29:43,740
♪There will always
be someone to share it with♪

395
00:29:43,740 --> 00:29:46,620
♪Our bond runs deep♪

396
00:29:48,000 --> 00:29:48,790
Lanxiang.

397
00:29:50,550 --> 00:29:52,000
Now that you've married me,

398
00:29:53,880 --> 00:29:55,510
stop thinking about Han Liang.

399
00:29:58,110 --> 00:29:59,350
The past cannot be undone,

400
00:30:00,344 --> 00:30:02,024
but the future is still ours to shape.

401
00:30:04,680 --> 00:30:06,590
Whether he's Provincial Examination
Top Scholar Han

402
00:30:07,680 --> 00:30:08,750
or Top Imperial Scholar Han,

403
00:30:11,480 --> 00:30:12,680
he has nothing to do with us.

404
00:30:14,880 --> 00:30:17,720
Young Master, Old Master sent word

405
00:30:17,880 --> 00:30:19,240
that he wishes to see you.

406
00:30:19,272 --> 00:30:21,416
He's already waiting
for you in the ancestral hall.

407
00:31:01,400 --> 00:31:01,880
Grandfather.

408
00:31:46,960 --> 00:31:47,550
Grandfather,

409
00:31:49,070 --> 00:31:50,590
you summoned me here.

410
00:31:50,888 --> 00:31:52,264
What guidance do you have for me?

411
00:31:54,960 --> 00:31:56,160
Do you know

412
00:31:57,350 --> 00:31:59,880
I'm not pleased
that you're going to the capital?

413
00:32:03,030 --> 00:32:04,350
I had some sense of that.

414
00:32:05,200 --> 00:32:06,030
I just don't know

415
00:32:06,830 --> 00:32:07,880
the reason behind it.

416
00:32:10,920 --> 00:32:12,590
This move to the capital

417
00:32:13,510 --> 00:32:17,030
may seem like a promotion
that brings honor to our family,

418
00:32:18,200 --> 00:32:22,200
but fortune often conceals misfortune.

419
00:32:26,640 --> 00:32:28,000
I'm afraid that one day,

420
00:32:28,830 --> 00:32:31,830
the destruction of the Lin family

421
00:32:33,640 --> 00:32:35,440
may begin with you.

422
00:32:39,440 --> 00:32:40,590
Though I may be unworthy,

423
00:32:41,000 --> 00:32:43,270
I've always kept your teachings
and my mentor's in mind.

424
00:32:43,960 --> 00:32:46,160
I've never done
anything to disgrace our family.

425
00:32:47,912 --> 00:32:49,590
Why would you say that, Grandfather?

426
00:32:50,790 --> 00:32:54,200
The sages taught the Three Bonds
and Five Constant Virtues.

427
00:32:55,750 --> 00:32:56,790
Have you lived by them?

428
00:33:03,288 --> 00:33:04,680
Marrying without telling you

429
00:33:05,270 --> 00:33:06,480
was indeed my fault.

430
00:33:08,160 --> 00:33:08,590
But...

431
00:33:11,096 --> 00:33:12,310
I did inform His Majesty.

432
00:33:17,310 --> 00:33:18,510
The father guides the son.

433
00:33:19,350 --> 00:33:21,680
Today, when your father
goes against your wishes,

434
00:33:21,680 --> 00:33:24,440
you dare use
the sovereign's authority against him.

435
00:33:25,270 --> 00:33:26,750
The sovereign guides his subjects.

436
00:33:27,240 --> 00:33:29,960
If one day the sovereign
goes against your wishes,

437
00:33:30,160 --> 00:33:33,240
what will you dare use against him then?

438
00:33:38,920 --> 00:33:40,740
Grandfather,
that's too grave an accusation.

439
00:33:40,750 --> 00:33:41,830
I would never do that,

440
00:33:42,440 --> 00:33:43,160
nor would I dare.

441
00:33:49,880 --> 00:33:51,510
Observe what a man does.

442
00:33:52,480 --> 00:33:54,240
Consider why he does it.

443
00:33:55,110 --> 00:33:57,440
See where his heart finds peace.

444
00:33:59,310 --> 00:34:01,240
How can he hide his true self?

445
00:34:03,070 --> 00:34:05,880
Can you swear before our ancestors

446
00:34:05,880 --> 00:34:10,360
that you've never deceived
His Majesty or defied his authority?

447
00:34:13,230 --> 00:34:15,400
What exactly did this man do

448
00:34:16,710 --> 00:34:19,960
that forced him to leave his homeland
and seek refuge overseas?

449
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:21,840
His clan was fighting
over the family estate.

450
00:34:21,960 --> 00:34:23,320
After his father lost the dispute,

451
00:34:23,384 --> 00:34:24,760
he disappeared without a trace.

452
00:34:24,952 --> 00:34:26,550
He no longer wanted to fight over it,

453
00:34:27,280 --> 00:34:29,230
but his relatives didn't believe him.

454
00:34:29,304 --> 00:34:31,096
They were determined to eliminate him.

455
00:34:31,480 --> 00:34:33,030
(Afraid of implicating anyone else,)

456
00:34:33,096 --> 00:34:34,760
(he had no choice but to flee far away.)

457
00:34:43,670 --> 00:34:44,400
Grandfather.

458
00:34:48,190 --> 00:34:48,800
I...

459
00:35:01,920 --> 00:35:03,440
I don't want to know

460
00:35:03,710 --> 00:35:05,150
what you've done,

461
00:35:06,400 --> 00:35:08,670
and I hope I never

462
00:35:09,710 --> 00:35:10,800
have to know.

463
00:35:18,070 --> 00:35:21,070
Serving the Emperor
is like living beside a tiger.

464
00:35:22,510 --> 00:35:23,550
I agreed to let

465
00:35:23,710 --> 00:35:25,550
Jinlan, Jinqiao, and Xiuwan

466
00:35:25,840 --> 00:35:27,320
go to the capital

467
00:35:27,800 --> 00:35:28,550
with you

468
00:35:29,110 --> 00:35:33,440
because I want you
to think of your siblings

469
00:35:33,440 --> 00:35:34,760
before you act

470
00:35:36,230 --> 00:35:39,190
and exercise some restraint.

471
00:36:01,670 --> 00:36:03,230
They all deserve

472
00:36:04,150 --> 00:36:06,280
to live well.

473
00:36:14,400 --> 00:36:15,550
To live.

474
00:36:16,230 --> 00:36:18,590
To live well.

475
00:36:43,760 --> 00:36:44,400
Grandfather.

476
00:36:44,550 --> 00:36:46,150
You agreed to let Jinlan come with us?

477
00:36:46,510 --> 00:36:47,510
Jinqi, that's wonderful!

478
00:36:48,344 --> 00:36:50,248
Thank you
for granting my wish, Grandfather.

479
00:36:51,710 --> 00:36:53,880
Did I pass your test, Jinqi?

480
00:36:54,840 --> 00:36:55,670
You did.

481
00:36:56,150 --> 00:36:57,510
Rest and recover, Jinqi.

482
00:36:57,510 --> 00:36:58,960
I'll study hard.

483
00:36:59,272 --> 00:37:00,400
I'll go make funny faces

484
00:37:00,920 --> 00:37:03,110
for Aunt Shunhua.

485
00:37:03,510 --> 00:37:05,760
Old Madam always laughs
when I make funny faces.

486
00:37:59,030 --> 00:38:00,510
You're awake, my lady.

487
00:38:07,760 --> 00:38:08,630
I'm on the ship?

488
00:38:11,840 --> 00:38:12,630
We've already

489
00:38:12,800 --> 00:38:15,000
been away from Longjiang Pass Wharf
for over four hours.

490
00:38:18,710 --> 00:38:19,550
Where's Zhi?

491
00:38:20,920 --> 00:38:22,030
The person you brought back

492
00:38:22,360 --> 00:38:24,000
was naturally brought aboard with us.

493
00:38:30,840 --> 00:38:31,800
Didn't she say anything?

494
00:38:34,480 --> 00:38:34,960
Say what?

495
00:38:51,760 --> 00:38:52,320
My lady.

496
00:38:53,440 --> 00:38:54,440
Are you still dizzy?

497
00:38:54,960 --> 00:38:56,190
Do you feel unwell anywhere?

498
00:39:07,110 --> 00:39:07,670
My lady.

499
00:39:08,590 --> 00:39:09,550
I was wrong.

500
00:39:10,190 --> 00:39:11,190
It was my fault.

501
00:39:11,920 --> 00:39:13,710
It took me so long to finally marry you.

502
00:39:14,550 --> 00:39:16,920
I truly couldn't bear to be apart
from you for even one day.

503
00:39:21,190 --> 00:39:22,190
I promise you

504
00:39:22,248 --> 00:39:24,110
I'll petition His Majesty
as soon as possible

505
00:39:24,190 --> 00:39:25,480
to transfer me back to Jinling.

506
00:39:28,070 --> 00:39:28,880
My lady.

507
00:39:30,000 --> 00:39:31,030
I know

508
00:39:31,230 --> 00:39:33,320
what I did this time
was far too reckless.

509
00:39:33,592 --> 00:39:35,140
I'll accept any punishment you give me.

510
00:39:35,160 --> 00:39:36,648
As long as it helps you calm down.

511
00:39:49,840 --> 00:39:51,150
If you're angry,

512
00:39:51,230 --> 00:39:52,320
just let it out.

513
00:39:52,920 --> 00:39:54,440
Hit me or scold me.

514
00:39:55,760 --> 00:39:57,710
Don't keep it bottled up inside.

515
00:39:58,230 --> 00:39:59,630
It's not good for your health.

516
00:40:07,400 --> 00:40:09,550
You actually drugged me
with a knockout drug.

517
00:40:10,590 --> 00:40:12,960
Even a play wouldn't dare make up
something this outrageous.

518
00:40:13,360 --> 00:40:15,440
Even if I wrote it,
no one would believe it.

519
00:40:15,710 --> 00:40:16,880
It wasn't a knockout drug.

520
00:40:19,880 --> 00:40:21,760
Well, it wasn't a knockout drug.

521
00:40:21,960 --> 00:40:25,150
I got a physician to prescribe
something to help you sleep.

522
00:40:26,190 --> 00:40:27,190
It won't harm you.

523
00:40:33,360 --> 00:40:35,110
But I clearly saw you drink it, too.

524
00:40:38,840 --> 00:40:39,920
I pretended.

525
00:40:40,670 --> 00:40:42,800
It looked like I drank it, but actually

526
00:40:43,960 --> 00:40:45,840
I poured it onto the

527
00:40:46,710 --> 00:40:47,800
handkerchief in my sleeve.

528
00:40:52,030 --> 00:40:54,760
Now that would make
a good scene in a play.

529
00:41:02,360 --> 00:41:05,550
So are you angry or not?

530
00:41:07,280 --> 00:41:08,110
Guess.

531
00:41:10,400 --> 00:41:11,510
Then you've forgiven me?

532
00:41:12,360 --> 00:41:14,710
I'll reserve judgment
and see how you behave.

533
00:41:18,880 --> 00:41:19,590
How I behave?

534
00:41:24,840 --> 00:41:26,880
Look at that miserable face of yours.

535
00:41:27,360 --> 00:41:28,670
Let me teach you a few tricks.

536
00:41:29,550 --> 00:41:32,360
You've got to be completely shameless.

537
00:41:32,550 --> 00:41:35,710
Then things will work out for you.

538
00:41:36,230 --> 00:41:38,110
Stop giving me bad advice.

539
00:41:38,840 --> 00:41:40,480
I've got five children already.

540
00:41:40,840 --> 00:41:42,110
You know about fighting.

541
00:41:42,800 --> 00:41:43,630
But women?

542
00:41:44,440 --> 00:41:45,360
That's my specialty.

543
00:41:46,510 --> 00:41:48,880
Persistence always wins a woman over.

544
00:41:49,360 --> 00:41:51,280
The ship is only so big.

545
00:41:52,110 --> 00:41:53,800
You're bound

546
00:41:54,280 --> 00:41:56,320
to keep running into each other.

547
00:41:56,880 --> 00:41:59,280
Get seasick, and she might
fall right into your arms.

548
00:41:59,560 --> 00:42:02,000
And when you bathe,
you'll have to undress, won't you?

549
00:42:03,920 --> 00:42:05,510
(Your wife is young.)

550
00:42:05,960 --> 00:42:07,000
(I guarantee)

551
00:42:07,320 --> 00:42:10,030
(she'll get all flustered
and start blushing.)

552
00:42:38,030 --> 00:42:40,000
I... undress.

553
00:42:56,728 --> 00:42:57,800
I want to take a bath.

554
00:43:05,260 --> 00:43:07,580
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

555
00:43:08,150 --> 00:43:10,000
Open your eyes and take a good look!

556
00:43:10,020 --> 00:43:11,860
It's your man
who's been pestering me all day.

557
